      "created_at": "2023-02-11T01:44:27.891Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In a game on the app the other day, I did something very similar by playing Gritty Reboot while Omnitron had Interpolation Beam in play. It worked about as you describe: draw card, get 1 damage, draw card, …, and you conveniently get the choice to stop drawing cards whenever you feel like you’ve had enough.</p>",
